<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS3" title="In 6 Discussion ‣ Intentional Deception as Controllable Capability in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3 </span>Minimal Attack Surface</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS4" title="In 6 Discussion ‣ Intentional Deception as Controllable Capability in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.4 </span>Limitations</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In Intentional Deception as Controllable Capability in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Intentional Deception as Controllable Capability in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
