<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Intentional Deception as Controllable Capability in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Profile-Level Deception Effects</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
